            "text": "The checked-in hashes are an independent release authority, not visual tolerances. Comparing only the downloaded bytes, sidecar, and GitHub digest would let a clobbered release pass when all three moved together; requiring this ratified v0.24.0 value turns replacement into an explicit source review.",
            "markdown": "The checked-in hashes are an independent release authority, not visual tolerances. Comparing only the downloaded bytes, sidecar, and GitHub digest would let a clobbered release pass when all three moved together; requiring this ratified v0.24.0 value turns replacement into an explicit source review."
